        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Delicious, creamy, clean, and made with ingredients your pantry would approve of. It's an oat beverage that just makes sense.</p><ul><li>Filtered Water</li><li>Canadian Organic Oats</li><li>Sea Salt</li><li>Sometimes Vanilla</li><li>…That's it.</li></ul>",
