    "label_truth": {
      "type": "varty-label-truth",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "THE OAT BEVERAGE THAT (ACTUALLY) LIVES UP TO THE LABEL",
        "body": "<p>Are \"healthy\" oat beverages as healthy as they claim to be? If you've read the labels like we have – and questioned the claims like we have – then you know the answer.</p><p>Like you, we care about what we put in our bodies, so if an ingredient doesn't belong in your pantry, it won't be in ours. VARTY is taking organic oat beverages back to basics with 3-4 ingredients. Only what matters. Nothing more, nothing masked. Just real ingredients, doing what they do best!</p>",
        "main_image": "varty-lifestyle-01.jpg",
        "thumb_1": "varty-lifestyle-02.jpg",
        "thumb_2": "varty-lifestyle-03.jpg",
        "desktop_padding_top": 72,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 72,
        "mobile_padding_top": 44,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 44
      }
    },
